:: MP Daily Robin 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "morning" or Time.dayState is "day">>白昼的孤儿院卧室透进暖阳，<<else>>孤儿院卧室点着柔和的台灯，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正盘腿坐在床沿修补几本给小孤儿看的故事画册。见你进来，他仰起脸露出温暖笑容：「胶水刚熬好，你帮我把脱页的画纸对齐好不好？」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_6 is 1>>
今日已帮过忙，先回去歇着。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-6">
<<mpreadicon>><<link "压平画册书脊 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-6">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>画册书脊平整牢固，罗宾开心地把头靠在你肩上，塞给你一块留好的黄油曲奇。<span class="green">与罗宾一起做手工的时光格外治愈。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	米糊胶水沾在了手指上，粘住了半页画纸。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>忙拿湿帕子替你擦净手指。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[弯腰再压平书脊 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link "给插画补色 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-6">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>补好色彩的小木屋插画栩栩如生，罗宾眼睛亮晶晶地夸个不停。<span class="green">他微红的脸颊透着满满的依恋。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	彩铅笔芯脆断了一截，在纸边留下一道浅痕。<span class="red">你拿起小刀准备重新削尖笔芯。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再给插画补色 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Robin 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>夜色渐深的孤儿院卧室里，<<else>>收摊归来的孤儿院房间里，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把热气腾腾的苹果肉桂茶端到小桌上，又从铁皮储蓄罐里数出几枚亮闪闪的银币推给你：「这周多亏你一直护着我的摊位，这是我们俩的共同积蓄。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_7 is 1>>
茶已饮过，改日再来叙话。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-7">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "卷好零钱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-7">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_7 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_7")>><<money 450>>零钱筒码得整整齐齐，罗宾羞涩地握住你的手，把你那份分红塞进你口袋。<<else>>零钱筒按面额码得整整齐齐，罗宾羞涩地握住你的手贴在脸颊旁。<</if>><span class="green">相依为命的温暖驱散了所有阴霾。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	包装纸卷松了一下，几枚铜币滚落桌面。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>笑着和你一起把铜币拢回来。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拢袖再卷好零钱 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "搭毯共饮茶 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-7">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_7 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_7_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>一条毛毯裹住两人的体温，罗宾安心地依偎着你，把攒下的信物铜牌塞进你手心。<<else>>一条厚毛毯裹住两人的体温，罗宾安心地靠在你肩头轻声细语。<</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><span class="green">窗外风雨再大也吹不进这方温暖角落。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	茶杯稍烫了一下嘴唇，你连忙吹了吹热气。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>关切地替你兑入少许温水。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再搭毯共饮茶 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[改日再来 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Daily Eden 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.season is "autumn" or Time.season is "winter">>深林冷风吹过木屋前的菜畦，<<else>>森林光线洒在木屋前的菜畦上，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>正在加固外围的防兽木桩。看见你走出来，他把柄部磨得光滑的短斧递给你：「把那几根松木桩削尖，天黑前我们要把东侧围栏补好。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_6 is 1>>
今日已收拾停当，明日再来。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-6">
<<mpfarmicon>><<link "削尖松木桩 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-6">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>木桩削得匀称锋利，伊甸接过去三两下砸入土中，难得赞许地拍了拍你的肩。<span class="green">你们在林间劳作中愈发默契。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	松木结疤崩偏了斧刃，震得你虎口发麻。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>皱眉握住你的手腕检查有没有伤着。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[侧身再削尖松木桩 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link "绑紧木横梁 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-6">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>十字绳结扎得密不透风，伊甸顺手替你拭去额角汗珠，眼底透出柔和神色。<span class="green">有你搭手，整片营地都安稳下来。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	粗麻绳刺扎了一下指腹，绳扣松了半寸。<span class="red">你戴上皮护指准备重新收紧。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓步再绑紧木横梁 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雨敲打着木屋屋顶，<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨水敲打着木屋屋顶，<<else>>壁炉的松柴烧得正旺，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>在火炉边铺开一张刚硝制好的厚实鹿皮毯。他把烤得焦香的松鸡腿递给你，又将一袋卖兽皮换来的银币放在桌上：「拿去买你需要的东西，家里不缺你的。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_7 is 1>>
今天已陪跑一趟，先回吧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-7">
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "擦干他的发梢 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-7">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_7 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_7")>><<money 450>>伊甸顺从地低头任你擦拭，随后长臂一伸将你揽上鹿皮毯，把银币塞进你衣袋。<<else>>伊甸顺从地低头任你擦拭伤处，随后长臂一伸将你揽上鹿皮毯。<</if>><span class="green">火光映照着他难得流露的温存。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	炉边火星爆了一下，惊得你手腕微缩。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>伸手挡在你身前拨开了火炭。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[回手再擦干发梢 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link "煮一壶果茶 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-7">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_7 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden trust 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_7_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>酸甜温热的浆果茶驱散了山林夜寒，伊甸与你分饮一壶，将兽皮款项交给你收管。<<else>>酸甜温热的浆果茶驱散了山林夜寒，伊甸与你并肩坐在炉火边。<</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><span class="green">木屋里的烟火气令彼此心安。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜壶柄有些烫手，倒茶时洒出了几滴。<span class="red">你裹上厚布垫住壶柄准备再倒。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶墙再煮一壶果茶 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[改日再来 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Daily Wren 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>黄昏海风吹过三号货栈，<<else>>旧港背风的集装箱夹道里，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>正斜倚在木桶上保养他的簧片暗锁匣。看见你走过来，他笑着朝你招手：「这批新到的铜锁簧挺有意思，要不要上手试试手感？」
暗锁匣盖内侧压着半张盖了火漆的进港清单。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<link [[回雷恩身边 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_wren_6 is 1>>
今日已核对无误，改天再来。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-wren-6">
<<sneakicon>><<link "拨落三枚铜簧 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-6">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>>咔哒一声脆响锁舌弹开，雷恩吹了声口哨，赞叹地拍了拍你的手背。<span class="green">你在他面前的手法愈发老练。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	第三枚铜簧回弹力极强，震麻了你的指尖。<span class="red"><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>笑着按住你的手腕指点发力巧劲。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借光再拨落铜簧 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "核对进港清单 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-6">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_6 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>>你三两下查出两箱夹带私货的编号，雷恩挑眉一笑，将热披肩搭在你肩上。<span class="green">他看你的眼神里多了几分真切欣赏。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海雾打潮了清单纸角，字迹看得有些模糊。<span class="red">你凑近防风马灯准备重新辨认。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓气再核对清单 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Wren 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.hour gte 20>>夜深后的港湾暗栈只亮着一盏红灯笼，<<else>>清完货单的港湾暗栈里，<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>在木箱上摆开两只锡杯，将一袋沉甸甸的走私抽成推到你面前：「跟你搭伙从来没出过岔子，这笔红利专门留给你。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if mpNpcMet("Wren")>><<link [[回雷恩身边 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_wren_7 is 1>>
今天已照料周全，先回前头。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-wren-7">
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "与他碰杯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-7">>
