	<<set $daily.mpDaily_sydney_7 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_sydney_7")>><<money 450>>悉尼耳根红透，鼓起勇气在你脸颊上飞快亲了一下，把勤工补贴塞进你手心。<<else>>悉尼耳根红透，鼓起勇气在你脸颊上飞快亲了一下，笑得眉眼弯弯。<</if>><span class="green">心头暖意融融。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|School Library]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
